WEBVTT

00:02.252 --> 00:05.797
With support from the Penal Hero Unit's
dragoon reinforcements,

00:05.880 --> 00:08.591
we successfully repelled
a band of assassins.

00:08.675 --> 00:11.886
However, the Holy Knights' perimeter
was breached at multiple points,

00:11.970 --> 00:14.139
and nearly half of them were killed.

00:14.723 --> 00:17.809
It was a sneak attack
to isolate Goddess Teoritta and us.

00:18.727 --> 00:20.562
A perfectly executed assault.

00:20.645 --> 00:24.315
Is there a traitor among us?

00:24.399 --> 00:26.693
If we can't trust our own,

00:26.776 --> 00:28.528
we won't be able to fight properly.

00:29.112 --> 00:32.615
The snipers deployed throughout the area
were almost completely wiped out.

00:33.199 --> 00:35.702
I believe the security arrangements
for Goddess Teoritta

00:35.785 --> 00:37.912
should be re-evaluated
by trusted individuals.

00:37.996 --> 00:39.122
There's no point in that.

00:41.708 --> 00:44.753
The so-called "trusted individuals"
are themselves suspicious.

00:45.545 --> 00:47.881
Even those sitting here
right now should be suspected.

00:49.466 --> 00:52.802
Shouldn't the penal heroes
be the most suspicious?

00:52.886 --> 00:55.764
At the very least,
we need an internal investigation.

00:55.847 --> 00:58.016
Let's contact
the Twelfth Order of the Holy Knights.

00:58.099 --> 01:02.437
They specialize in espionage,
but they've never appeared publicly.

01:02.520 --> 01:05.940
If we don't know who to trust,
we can't fight.

01:06.566 --> 01:08.234
You guys aren't wrong.

01:11.362 --> 01:13.406
I understand each of your opinions.

01:13.490 --> 01:17.410
I'd like to ask
for the advisor's opinion on this matter.

01:18.036 --> 01:20.413
What do you think, High Priest Marlen?

01:21.039 --> 01:21.873
Hmm...

01:22.540 --> 01:23.458
Let's see...

01:24.292 --> 01:28.588
I've only recently been assigned here
from the First Capital.

01:29.172 --> 01:31.508
Including myself,

01:31.591 --> 01:34.969
whether we can trust each other
is an extremely important issue.

01:35.053 --> 01:36.471
But to be honest,

01:36.554 --> 01:39.182
I don't know if I can mobilize
the Intelligence Unit.

01:39.891 --> 01:42.060
How's the prisoner interrogation going,
Patausche?

01:42.852 --> 01:44.771
It's not progressing.

01:44.854 --> 01:49.400
Most of the captured survivors
are adventurers with no key intel.

01:50.401 --> 01:53.363
If only we could catch those assassins...

01:53.446 --> 01:54.948
Don't worry about it.

01:55.448 --> 01:59.202
You carry too much responsibility
for your actions.

02:00.036 --> 02:03.832
Too much regret and anxiety
won't lead to good results.

02:06.000 --> 02:08.586
I'll keep that in mind, Uncle.

02:08.670 --> 02:10.547
Still so reserved.

02:11.172 --> 02:14.592
I suppose that's just like you,
Patausche Kivia.

02:14.676 --> 02:15.760
High Priest.

02:15.844 --> 02:17.428
- Yes?
- Xylo, not another word.

02:17.512 --> 02:20.390
My opinion will surely come in handy.

02:20.473 --> 02:24.686
Otherwise, I wouldn't have raised
my hand before a great man like you.

02:25.895 --> 02:28.815
It may be sharp,
but it helps smooth things over.

02:29.440 --> 02:32.819
Patausche, you can use it as a reference.

02:32.902 --> 02:34.279
Yes...

02:34.863 --> 02:37.740
Well then, Hero Xylo.

02:38.324 --> 02:40.702
Let's hear your opinion.

02:40.785 --> 02:44.164
Alright, we should first look
for the adventurers' intermediary.

02:44.831 --> 02:46.708
In other words, the Guild.

02:54.048 --> 02:55.550
Lideo Sodrick...

02:56.259 --> 02:58.511
Is this guy the representative
of the Adventurers Guild?

02:58.595 --> 03:01.306
It's said that this man's ancestor
gathered private armies

03:01.389 --> 03:04.976
and suppressed the pirates
that rampaged in Korio Bay.

03:05.560 --> 03:07.270
And that seems to be the reason
the Guild was founded.

03:07.770 --> 03:10.064
While it sounds like a good origin story,

03:10.148 --> 03:13.443
it's ultimately just a turf war
between pirates, isn't it?

03:13.526 --> 03:15.278
Regardless of the actual situation,

03:15.361 --> 03:17.614
Lideo Sodrick
is a famous figure in the city.

03:18.323 --> 03:20.867
This place,
known as the "Sodrick's Shell",

03:20.950 --> 03:23.828
can be said to be the history
of the Adventurers Guild itself.

03:29.959 --> 03:31.127
Xylo.

03:33.630 --> 03:34.881
Are things alright?

03:35.381 --> 03:37.508
Huh? What do you mean?

03:37.592 --> 03:39.177
No, I mean...

03:39.260 --> 03:42.513
Were you given
any new punishments or anything?

03:49.395 --> 03:50.438
I'm fine.

03:50.521 --> 03:52.774
No one picked a fight with me.

03:53.733 --> 03:54.692
I see...

03:55.360 --> 03:56.194
What?

03:56.819 --> 04:00.406
Are you trying to get your hands
on that female sniper this time?

04:00.490 --> 04:01.741
Of course not.

04:01.824 --> 04:03.952
That's not what I meant...

04:05.745 --> 04:08.122
No, it's nothing.

04:08.206 --> 04:09.582
Then what is it?

04:13.169 --> 04:15.171
Let's go over the candidates
for the mission.

04:15.255 --> 04:17.298
You can consult me if you'd like.

04:17.382 --> 04:20.760
No, I said there's nothing to discuss.

04:22.720 --> 04:25.223
It's really not like that.

04:26.266 --> 04:29.060
It's not like that at all.

04:32.981 --> 04:35.358
I can't believe we failed...

04:35.441 --> 04:37.819
The dragoon wasn't part of the plan.

04:37.902 --> 04:41.072
The heroes are more formidable
than I'd heard.

04:41.155 --> 04:43.783
What's more,
that guy is a complete amateur.

04:43.866 --> 04:46.327
It's best to remove him or kill him.

04:46.995 --> 04:48.288
Are you talking about me?

04:48.371 --> 04:52.333
Boojum was found at my gambling house.

04:52.417 --> 04:54.294
It was a bloodbath at that time.

04:55.211 --> 04:57.505
Ten adventurers who caused trouble.

04:57.588 --> 04:59.465
Every single one of them died.

05:03.011 --> 05:06.139
If you think he's an amateur,
then educate him properly.

05:07.056 --> 05:08.599
He might hold me back.

05:09.183 --> 05:10.935
I want more money.

05:12.520 --> 05:15.440
You're asking for more money
just because the enemy's a bit stronger?

05:22.739 --> 05:23.781
I see...

05:23.865 --> 05:26.617
This seems like a provocation aimed at me...

05:26.701 --> 05:29.704
Brother, this woman is a stray dog.

05:29.787 --> 05:31.706
She has no specific owner,
so she's very dangerous.

05:32.415 --> 05:34.167
Iri, stand back.

05:35.418 --> 05:36.544
It's fine.

05:38.963 --> 05:39.922
Shiji Bau.

05:40.006 --> 05:43.009
The Adventurers Guild isn't
like the army you were in.

05:45.553 --> 05:47.930
If you quit, you won't get paid.

05:49.265 --> 05:50.892
Prepare three times this amount.

05:53.603 --> 05:55.730
I'll need to hire people too.

05:55.813 --> 05:57.065
A professional this time.

05:57.148 --> 05:58.316
You!

05:58.399 --> 06:00.735
I'd like to ask for more money too.

06:01.569 --> 06:03.613
I want to buy another book.

06:04.280 --> 06:06.574
I really like this author.

06:07.200 --> 06:08.910
Altoyard Comette...

06:09.660 --> 06:11.788
He's a great poet.

06:16.584 --> 06:19.295
Brother, do you think it'll go well?

06:19.962 --> 06:22.799
You don't have to worry about anything.

06:27.762 --> 06:30.223
Is there someone you're worried about?

06:49.659 --> 06:51.953
It's rare to see you
so early in the morning.

06:52.036 --> 06:54.413
Did Neely kick you
out of the dragon stable?

06:54.497 --> 06:55.706
- That's right.
- What?

06:55.790 --> 06:58.042
Neely's jealous.

06:58.126 --> 07:00.753
She saw me with the other dragons.

07:01.254 --> 07:03.631
But it's not what she thinks...

07:03.714 --> 07:07.218
Hey, don't push Jayce's buttons.

07:07.885 --> 07:10.930
You two fight every chance you get.

07:11.013 --> 07:12.098
That's not true.

07:12.682 --> 07:13.808
Yes, it is.

07:13.891 --> 07:17.562
From my perspective, you two
are the epitome of anger and violence.

07:17.645 --> 07:19.730
- If possible, I hope
- They're heroes.

07:19.814 --> 07:21.566
- we can stagger our meal times.
- The one with the scary eyes

07:21.649 --> 07:23.192
is Xylo Forbartz, right?

07:23.276 --> 07:24.694
- Where's Teoritta?
- I heard he's a lunatic who carved

07:24.777 --> 07:25.778
- Isn't she with you?
- sacred seals all over his body.

07:25.862 --> 07:27.321
She's still asleep.

07:28.072 --> 07:29.115
And,

07:29.198 --> 07:31.200
I need a favor from you.
She can't hear about this.

07:31.784 --> 07:32.785
Huh?

07:32.869 --> 07:34.078
Oh, come on.

07:34.162 --> 07:35.955
You want me to do something again,
don't you?

07:36.038 --> 07:37.457
That's right.

07:37.540 --> 07:39.625
And it's something dangerous, right?

07:39.709 --> 07:42.712
Something you can't
bring Teoritta along for?

07:42.795 --> 07:44.839
Yeah, you get it, don't you?

07:46.757 --> 07:48.468
Come on, cheer up.

07:49.218 --> 07:51.345
You can go out without handcuffs,
you know.

07:51.429 --> 07:55.308
That's easy to say,
but Tsav had a hard time, didn't he?

07:55.391 --> 07:57.643
I heard his right arm was crushed.

07:57.727 --> 07:58.769
Yeah.

07:58.853 --> 08:01.439
He was lucky
that it was just his right arm.

08:02.565 --> 08:05.067
By the way, what kind of operation is it?

08:06.027 --> 08:08.112
First, you'll infiltrate
the Adventurers Guild.

08:09.155 --> 08:12.366
If it's the Adventurers Guild,
wouldn't it be better to ask Rhyno?

08:12.450 --> 08:14.243
He used to be an adventurer, right?

08:14.327 --> 08:15.495
No.

08:15.578 --> 08:17.580
Rhyno is in the punishment room right now.

08:17.663 --> 08:19.624
We can't predict what he'll do.

08:20.416 --> 08:23.044
What about Venetim?

08:23.127 --> 08:25.296
He went to the repair shop
with His Majesty.

08:25.379 --> 08:27.715
It seems they finally found
a suitable leg.

08:27.798 --> 08:29.717
But...

08:30.676 --> 08:32.803
If you won't do it, Dotta, then I will.

08:33.387 --> 08:34.514
I'm free today anyway.

08:34.597 --> 08:37.141
What? Really? Then--

08:38.309 --> 08:41.145
Dotta, I need your skills.

08:43.606 --> 08:44.690
Alright.

08:46.400 --> 08:48.945
Don't cause trouble for Dotta.

08:49.695 --> 08:54.951
Dotta once fed his own hand
to a hungry dragon.

08:55.785 --> 08:57.995
I don't even know if I could go that far.

09:00.957 --> 09:03.376
He respects you, surprisingly.

09:03.918 --> 09:05.628
Let's not talk about that.

09:05.711 --> 09:06.754
So?

09:06.837 --> 09:08.548
What exactly are we going to do?

09:08.631 --> 09:10.591
In what form do you want me to infiltrate?

09:11.801 --> 09:12.969
Well...

09:24.272 --> 09:25.773
Is there a problem?

09:26.357 --> 09:30.486
Or do you still think I look like
I'm wearing men's clothes?

09:34.740 --> 09:36.867
No, this outfit suits you.

09:37.451 --> 09:39.579
You truly look like a noble lady.

09:40.162 --> 09:42.290
I'm sure you'll have many suitors.

09:44.834 --> 09:47.336
N-No need to flatter me like that.

09:47.420 --> 09:49.297
Even if you compliment me,

09:49.380 --> 09:52.174
it won't affect my mood at all.

09:52.258 --> 09:53.843
That's good.

09:53.926 --> 09:56.762
But what kind of job request
should we make up...?

09:57.930 --> 10:01.434
When it comes to Adventurers Guild jobs,
it's about eliminating faeries, right?

10:01.934 --> 10:04.604
That's the military's job, right?

10:05.146 --> 10:07.231
How about dealing with bandits?

10:07.898 --> 10:11.277
Both of you are using
way too much violence.

10:11.360 --> 10:13.821
If this were the border,
they might get a request like that.

10:13.904 --> 10:15.656
But this is Ioff.

10:15.740 --> 10:18.701
What kind of request
do you think is suitable then?

10:21.746 --> 10:23.956
Ah... then...

10:24.498 --> 10:28.127
We'll set you up
as a nobleman's wife and her lover.

10:28.210 --> 10:29.337
- What?!
- Huh?

10:29.420 --> 10:31.797
And the two of you
are plotting to kill her husband.

10:32.298 --> 10:35.301
Is there a nobleman you want to kill?

10:38.220 --> 10:40.181
Defendant Dotta Luzulas,

10:40.723 --> 10:44.226
you have over 1,000 criminal charges.

10:45.728 --> 10:46.729
Yes...

10:46.812 --> 10:50.941
But there's only one crime
you're being charged with here.

10:51.025 --> 10:53.694
That is the crime of escaping
from the royal castle prison

10:53.778 --> 10:56.781
and stealing that dragon.

10:59.700 --> 11:02.370
Huh? Wait... wait a minute.

11:02.453 --> 11:03.412
What is it?

11:03.496 --> 11:04.747
What about that child?

11:04.830 --> 11:07.416
Doesn't that count as one of my crimes?

11:07.500 --> 11:10.503
- What are you talking about?
- The crown prince!

11:11.087 --> 11:12.880
- He said the crown prince.
- What does he mean?

11:12.963 --> 11:14.507
What does this have to do
with His Highness?

11:14.590 --> 11:18.219
That child told me, "Please save me."

11:18.302 --> 11:19.220
It's true.

11:19.804 --> 11:21.722
He said he was locked up
in the royal castle

11:21.806 --> 11:23.182
and asked me to help him escape.

11:23.933 --> 11:25.643
That's why I tried to use
the dragon to help him escape.

11:25.726 --> 11:27.603
Cease this nonsense!

11:29.146 --> 11:31.065
There's no truth to the claim

11:31.148 --> 11:34.026
that the crown prince
ever said such things to you.

11:34.735 --> 11:37.238
Nor is there any truth to the claim
that he wished to leave the royal castle.

11:37.321 --> 11:40.074
No... that's not true.

11:40.157 --> 11:42.493
I met him while escaping prison.

11:42.576 --> 11:45.454
He must be the first prince
of this Federated Kingdom.

11:45.538 --> 11:47.748
He's about ten years old,

11:47.832 --> 11:49.291
with timid eyes.

11:50.167 --> 11:51.794
He told me the royal family is strange.

11:52.420 --> 11:54.130
He also said His Majesty
had been acting strangely for some time,

11:54.213 --> 11:55.381
so it must be the chancellor--

11:55.464 --> 11:58.134
Silence, Dotta Luzulas.

11:58.217 --> 11:59.635
N-No.

11:59.718 --> 12:02.263
There really is something wrong
with the royal family.

12:02.346 --> 12:06.392
After all, the crown prince
even tried to rely on someone like me!

12:06.934 --> 12:08.936
To rely on someone like me...

12:09.019 --> 12:11.897
a m-mere petty thief.

12:12.481 --> 12:13.691
Silence!

12:13.774 --> 12:16.360
Even I have a conscience.

12:16.944 --> 12:19.822
It's just that not many people
can stir my conscience.

12:20.406 --> 12:24.660
But if someone is weaker than me,
like the crown prince was then,

12:25.369 --> 12:27.746
it's only natural to want
to help him, isn't it?

12:33.377 --> 12:35.212
This is too strange.

12:35.796 --> 12:39.049
If that's the case,
who would help that child then?

12:40.050 --> 12:43.220
Please, you must save that child!

12:43.804 --> 12:46.140
It seems we can't continue
the interrogation.

12:46.223 --> 12:50.352
Inquisitor, I believe the death penalty
is the most appropriate verdict.

12:50.436 --> 12:52.897
Yes, you're right.

12:52.980 --> 12:57.067
But this man has been sentenced
to an even harsher punishment.

12:58.319 --> 12:59.737
And who rendered this judgment?

13:00.362 --> 13:03.616
It was proposed
by the Central Alliance of Nobles.

13:03.699 --> 13:05.576
It's already been decided.

13:07.912 --> 13:08.954
What the heck...

13:09.038 --> 13:10.998
Next time, I'll definitely steal it...

13:11.081 --> 13:13.125
Dotta Luzulas.

13:13.209 --> 13:14.210
You are being sentenced

13:14.793 --> 13:16.587
to serve as a hero.

13:23.802 --> 13:25.137
It's a huge hassle,

13:25.971 --> 13:27.723
but I have to do it...

13:37.525 --> 13:39.735
Hey, I have some good stuff here.

13:39.818 --> 13:41.153
Would you like some?

13:42.112 --> 13:43.405
- They're ignoring me.
- Damn it.

13:44.323 --> 13:45.783
This is unpleasant.

13:47.993 --> 13:49.328
Dragon's Breath...

13:49.912 --> 13:52.039
Is that the tobacco
that became popular because of Jayce?

13:52.122 --> 13:54.500
That is a clear and undeniable crime.

13:57.836 --> 13:58.963
By the way,

13:59.046 --> 14:01.423
why did you join the military?

14:03.300 --> 14:04.385
What do you mean?

14:04.468 --> 14:07.346
The daughter of a priest
who holds vast territories

14:07.429 --> 14:09.848
wouldn't need to join the army, would she?

14:11.225 --> 14:12.268
That's because...

14:14.019 --> 14:16.522
Both of my parents are priests.

14:16.605 --> 14:18.941
They both hold positions at the Temple.

14:19.024 --> 14:20.860
And they've gained
various benefits from it.

14:21.861 --> 14:23.404
Benefits...

14:23.487 --> 14:27.241
Are they those noble priests
who turn authority and faith into money?

14:27.825 --> 14:29.118
Yes.

14:29.201 --> 14:32.830
It seems they didn't rely solely
on legitimate means like donations.

14:32.913 --> 14:36.250
I hated that about my parents.

14:36.750 --> 14:39.920
So I wanted to live
a different life from them.

14:40.004 --> 14:41.881
That's why I decided to join the army.

14:46.302 --> 14:47.136
That's...

14:47.636 --> 14:49.847
It's my first training sword.

14:51.015 --> 14:52.808
My uncle bought it for me.

14:55.227 --> 14:59.398
I want to live my own life
with my own talent.

14:59.982 --> 15:03.861
My uncle supported me in that.

15:07.740 --> 15:09.199
By the way, Xylo.

15:09.283 --> 15:13.245
- Your... fiancée...
- Xylo.

15:14.038 --> 15:15.539
I went to see the guild.

15:16.665 --> 15:18.459
That was fast. Impressive.

15:19.126 --> 15:20.961
Almost a little too fast.

15:21.545 --> 15:23.964
Their security seems to be very tight.

15:24.048 --> 15:26.050
There are about 20 guards.

15:26.133 --> 15:27.426
That's fewer than I expected.

15:27.509 --> 15:30.095
But there are strange children
wandering around.

15:30.638 --> 15:32.222
I think they are assassins.

15:32.306 --> 15:33.974
Children?

15:34.058 --> 15:35.601
Unforgivable...

15:35.684 --> 15:41.106
I've heard of raising orphans
to turn them into loyal soldiers.

15:44.693 --> 15:45.527
Anyway,

15:46.487 --> 15:49.865
I just need to kidnap the representative
while you two infiltrate, right?

15:49.949 --> 15:52.993
Though I don't have any pleasant memories
of kidnapping people.

15:53.077 --> 15:54.536
Just do it.

15:55.037 --> 15:58.332
Kivia, you're the daughter
of a wealthy noble.

15:58.415 --> 15:59.708
And I'm your lover.

16:01.126 --> 16:03.087
I... I know.

16:03.170 --> 16:04.213
Leave it to me!

16:05.756 --> 16:06.840
Ouch.

16:09.176 --> 16:13.097
Looks like it's truly the penal hero,
Xylo Forbartz.

16:13.180 --> 16:17.059
There's no doubt
the other woman is a Holy Knight.

16:17.142 --> 16:19.269
Xylo Forbartz.

16:19.353 --> 16:20.771
This is the worst...

16:20.854 --> 16:23.524
But if this goes well...

16:24.108 --> 16:26.318
If we can capture him alive...

16:27.528 --> 16:29.613
Then I'll wait
for the right time to strike.

16:30.781 --> 16:32.950
Contact Shiji Bau and the others.

16:33.033 --> 16:35.619
Just in case, wake up Duhrsami too.

16:38.455 --> 16:39.915
Don't let them go back.

16:40.416 --> 16:41.792
Understood.

16:52.511 --> 16:54.722
This is for my family too.

17:06.358 --> 17:08.318
I'd like you to kill someone for me.

17:09.653 --> 17:10.571
What?

17:10.654 --> 17:13.782
I know it's a rude request,
but I would prefer someone experienced.

17:14.783 --> 17:17.077
Excuse me, but who are you?

17:17.161 --> 17:18.954
I'm Madleen.

17:19.038 --> 17:20.831
Please don't ask for my family name.

17:20.914 --> 17:21.749
Yes...

17:24.501 --> 17:27.421
Well then, who referred you here?

17:28.130 --> 17:30.299
Do you take assassination requests or not?

17:30.799 --> 17:31.633
Give me an answer.

17:31.717 --> 17:33.510
Ms. Madleen.

17:33.594 --> 17:36.096
We don't accept just any job.

17:37.014 --> 17:38.766
I'm sorry, miss.

17:38.849 --> 17:42.561
My lady has lived a sheltered life,
and she's never been to a place like this.

17:42.644 --> 17:45.773
We don't have a letter of recommendation,
but we're truly at our wits' end.

17:45.856 --> 17:47.775
Worst-case scenario,
at least let us leave this town

17:47.858 --> 17:49.735
without a trace.

17:50.736 --> 17:52.446
Let me ask you this.

17:53.113 --> 17:54.490
Who do you want to kill?

17:55.741 --> 17:58.952
Our target is her noble husband,
the bridge keepers of Ginai's...

17:59.036 --> 18:00.454
Have you heard of the Hystead family?

18:00.537 --> 18:01.622
No.

18:01.705 --> 18:04.166
He's the third son
from one of their branch families.

18:04.249 --> 18:06.043
There's been some trouble.

18:06.627 --> 18:09.338
Although I married
into the Hystead family,

18:09.421 --> 18:11.590
this man and I... uhm...

18:11.673 --> 18:15.010
swore our vows
under the sacred hargra tree!

18:15.094 --> 18:16.178
Yes...

18:16.261 --> 18:20.349
I want to kill my husband
and marry this man.

18:20.933 --> 18:24.103
I-I don't mind eloping with him!

18:24.186 --> 18:27.106
Ah, please... please wait a moment.

18:27.856 --> 18:30.025
- Those two look like trouble...
- I feel like

18:30.109 --> 18:31.485
- Should we report this to the higher-ups?
- they're doubting us.

18:31.568 --> 18:33.237
You're not just imagining it.

18:33.320 --> 18:35.739
- We don't know if she's really a noble.
- This is bad. What should we do?

18:35.823 --> 18:38.158
- You're right...
- If that's the case, we'll make a scene.

18:38.242 --> 18:39.368
What?

18:39.451 --> 18:41.537
We'll cause a ruckus and create chaos.

18:42.204 --> 18:44.123
It's what you'd call stealing
in the midst of chaos.

18:44.206 --> 18:47.459
And the one we're taking
is Lideo Sodrick himself.

18:47.543 --> 18:50.087
Wh-What kind of reckless plan is this?

18:50.170 --> 18:51.421
Anyway, let's do this.

18:52.172 --> 18:53.549
We'll start with those guys...

18:55.092 --> 18:58.053
You two seem to be looking
for skilled adventurers.

18:58.554 --> 18:59.638
- Wha--
- You are...

19:00.222 --> 19:01.932
You're Ms. Renzari.

19:02.641 --> 19:06.436
You're the wife of a nobleman,
and you're her lover.

19:06.520 --> 19:07.354
Am I right?

19:10.858 --> 19:12.651
May I use the room upstairs?

19:16.363 --> 19:18.031
How embarrassing, Xylo.

19:19.199 --> 19:20.993
It's the reaction I expected.

19:21.076 --> 19:22.828
What an absolute fool.

19:22.911 --> 19:27.374
If I hadn't come to your aid,
you would have been all tied up.

19:27.457 --> 19:31.211
No, we were planning
to cause a commotion there.

19:31.295 --> 19:33.881
That's right.
And our comrade will sneak in

19:33.964 --> 19:35.966
and find the evidence.
Everything is arranged.

19:36.550 --> 19:39.428
You're a member
of the Holy Knights, right?

19:40.012 --> 19:42.681
I am the Commander of the Thirteenth Order
of the Holy Knights,

19:42.764 --> 19:43.974
Patausche Kivia.

19:44.474 --> 19:47.895
Could you not spoil my fiancé too much?

19:47.978 --> 19:53.483
That man is still disgraceful, uneducated,
immature, and thoughtless.

19:53.567 --> 19:55.861
I don't want outsiders interfering.

19:55.944 --> 19:57.279
What outsiders?

19:57.362 --> 20:00.199
You're the outsider in this operation.

20:00.282 --> 20:01.867
I'm his fiancée.

20:01.950 --> 20:04.161
I'll stay by his side no matter what.

20:04.244 --> 20:06.330
Th-That doesn't change anything!

20:10.334 --> 20:14.880
I knew you two wouldn't get along
because of your personalities,

20:14.963 --> 20:16.215
but it's worse than I thought.

20:16.298 --> 20:18.175
What? Personalities?

20:18.258 --> 20:20.135
You said we don't get along?

20:20.219 --> 20:23.305
Why is that the best you can come up with?

20:23.388 --> 20:24.848
Are you really an idiot?

20:24.932 --> 20:27.559
No, he's beyond that level.

20:27.643 --> 20:30.270
He's terrible at reading people.

20:30.354 --> 20:31.772
I agree.

20:31.855 --> 20:34.233
His eyesight is like that
of a susubana mole.

20:34.316 --> 20:37.694
You could even say that the trees
by the roadside are smarter than him.

20:37.778 --> 20:40.739
Don't act all buddy-buddy
only when you're scolding me.

20:40.822 --> 20:42.866
This is not the time to play.

20:44.493 --> 20:47.371
And speaking of which, why are you here?

20:47.454 --> 20:50.374
We're posing as adventurers
to investigate.

20:50.999 --> 20:54.419
We're just one step away
from contacting Lideo Sodrick.

20:54.920 --> 20:57.047
Well then, sorry to bother you.

20:57.589 --> 20:58.924
Right now, we're also...

21:00.342 --> 21:01.885
Excuse me, esteemed guests.

21:01.969 --> 21:05.097
The Guild Master wishes
to know the details of your requests.

21:07.140 --> 21:10.018
Frenci, if you're going to pull out,
now's the time.

21:10.519 --> 21:11.561
Don't be ridiculous.

21:12.229 --> 21:13.772
I'm so dumbfounded, I can't even speak.

21:19.069 --> 21:21.530
It's so much easier
to just make a scene after all.

21:40.757 --> 21:42.134
You have no manners.

21:44.052 --> 21:45.846
It seems you weren't taught well.

22:17.711 --> 22:18.628
Here.

22:33.935 --> 22:35.687
Looks like this is going
to cause quite a stir.

22:39.733 --> 22:42.235
We didn't intend to do this...

22:42.319 --> 22:43.570
Unbelievable.

22:43.653 --> 22:45.822
- You actually did it.
- Yes.

22:45.906 --> 22:48.617
While we drive Lideo Sodrick out,

22:49.117 --> 22:51.286
we'll clean up the entire town as well.

22:52.579 --> 22:53.747
What is this...?

22:54.372 --> 22:56.541
This is what you call
a contribution to the community.

22:56.625 --> 22:58.835
This is really bad!
